    Senang mengulik baris kode, mengeksplorasi berbagai teknologi baru, dan merancang produk digital yang sederhana namun bermanfaat.
  </p>

  <!-- Tombol Aksi Taktil Mekanis (Neomorphic Mechanical Keycaps) -->
  <div class="flex flex-row justify-center gap-3 mt-4">
    <a 
      href="mailto:rahmanqolbi@gmail.com" 
      class="w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center bg-shadow-light rounded-[12px] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_var(--color-shadow-dark),_-2px_-2px_0px_rgba(216,233,168,0.15)] border border-lime-bud/10 hover:border-lime-bud/30 active:translate-y-[2px] active:shadow-[1px_1px_0px_var(--color-shadow-dark)] transition-all cursor-pointer text-lime-bud hover:text-white"
      aria-label="Kirim Email ke Rahman Qolbi"
    >
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4.5 h-4.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"/></svg>
    </a>
    <a 
      href="https://github.com/rahmanqolbi" 
      target="_blank" 
      rel="noreferrer" 
      class="w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center bg-shadow-light rounded-[12px] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_var(--color-shadow-dark),_-2px_-2px_0px_rgba(216,233,168,0.15)] border border-lime-bud/10 hover:border-lime-bud/30 active:translate-y-[2px] active:shadow-[1px_1px_0px_var(--color-shadow-dark)] transition-all cursor-pointer text-lime-bud hover:text-white"
      aria-label="Lihat GitHub Rahman Qolbi"
    >
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4.5 h-4.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 22v-4a4.8 4.8 0 0 0-1-3.5c3 0 6-2 6-5.5.08-1.25-.27-2.48-1-3.5.28-1.15.28-2.35 0-3.5 0 0-1 0-3 1.5-2.64-.5-5.36-.5-8 0C6 2 5 2 5 2c-.3 1.15-.3 2.35 0 3.5A5.403 5.403 0 0 0 4 9c0 3.5 3 5.5 6 5.5-.39.49-.68 1.05-.85 1.65-.17.6-.22 1.23-.15 1.85v4"/><path d="M9 18c-4.51 2-5-2-7-2"/></svg>
    </a>
    <a 
      href="https://instagram.com/rahmanqolbi" 
      target="_blank" 
      rel="noreferrer" 
      class="w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center bg-shadow-light rounded-[12px] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_var(--color-shadow-dark),_-2px_-2px_0px_rgba(216,233,168,0.15)] border border-lime-bud/10 hover:border-lime-bud/30 active:translate-y-[2px] active:shadow-[1px_1px_0px_var(--color-shadow-dark)] transition-all cursor-pointer text-lime-bud hover:text-white"
      aria-label="Lihat Instagram Rahman Qolbi"
    >
